The value 0x37634136 corresponds to an offset of 80 bytes, according to the pattern generator.
So, we need to send:
- shell code
- padding up to 80 bytes
- address of the run function (0x0804a008)

We used the shell code from [shell-strom](https://shell-storm.org/shellcode/files/shellcode-752.html)
Final exploit:
```bash
